  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 7506.10 Additional Requirement When License Holder is a Minor",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 7506.10 Additional Requirement When License Holder is a Minor. When a license holder is a minor, the parent or legal guardian shall appear at any hearings, and if the minor or parent is unable to pay the security amount in full, periodic payments may be ordered consistent with this part.\n\nSource. #13938, eff 4-24-24 (see Revision Note at chapter heading for Saf-C 7500)",
